#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:5
msgid "Replace folio property"
msgstr "替换财产"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the feature of automatic searching of `folios`_ with "
"an specific property for replacing `folio properties`_ without the need of "
"opening the folio properties PopUp window."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 提供了自动搜索 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 的特性，带有用于替换 `folio属性 <folio "
"properties_>`_ 的特定属性，而不需要打开folio属性波普窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:12
msgid ""
"If the `search menu`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Edit > "
"Search / Replace** menu item."
msgstr "如果不显示 `搜索菜单 <search menu_>`_，可以从 **编辑 > 搜索/替换** 菜单项中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:15
msgid "To replace some `folio properties`_:"
msgstr "替换一些 `组合属性 <folio properties_>`_ :"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Search`_ the content which should identify the `folio`_ from which a "
"property has to be changed."
msgstr "`搜索 <Search_>`_ 应标明必须改变财产的 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 的内容。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:22
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech search menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech搜索菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:24
msgid ""
"Press the **Folio** button to display the folio properties PopUp window."
msgstr "按 **Folio** 按钮显示 folio 属性 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:29
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech folio properties replace PopUp windows"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech folio 属性替换弹出窗口"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:31
msgid ""
"Fill the text line box from the `folio properties`_ which should be changed."
msgstr "从应当更改的 `组合属性 <folio properties_>`_ 中填充文本行框。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:35
msgid ""
"QElectroTech also allows deleting and making empty a filled property. Click "
"the checkbox button located right from the text which should be deleted."
msgstr "QElectroTech 还允许删除并空置一个已填充的属性。单击位于文本右侧的复选框按钮，该按钮应当删除 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:38
msgid "Press **Accept**."
msgstr "按 **接受**."

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:39
msgid ""
"From the `folios`_ found at the search process, select the `folios`_ where "
"the replace action have to be applied. The selection can be made at the "
"object tree from the `search menu`_."
msgstr ""
"从搜索过程中发现的 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 中，选择必须应用替换动作的 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 。选择可以在 `搜索菜单 <search"
" menu_>`_ 的对象树上进行。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:40
msgid ""
"Press **Replace all** button to apply the replace action to all selected "
"`folios`_."
msgstr "按 **替换所有** 按钮，将替换动作应用到所有选中 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:44
msgid ""
"Replacing action can also be applied `folio`_ by `folio`_. The button "
"**Replace** will only apply the action to the displayed `folio`_ at the "
"`workspace`_. The buttons |go-top| and |go-bottom| can be used to display "
"the previous and next `folio`_ from the search result."
msgstr ""
"替换动作也可以由 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 应用 `图幅 <folio_>`_。按钮 **替换** 只将动作应用到在 `图幅 <folio_>`_ "
"显示的 `工作区 <workspace_>`_，按钮 |go-top| 和 |go-bottom| 可以用来显示搜索结果中上一个和下一个 `图幅 "
"<folio_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:49
msgid "go-top"
msgstr "上进"

#: ../../source/users/schema/replace/folio_prop_replace.rst:48
msgid "go-bottom"
msgstr "向下移动"
